actions.supported_help = ʻOku lekooti ʻa e ngaahi fekau fili kuo fakapapauʻí, ngaahi Layer foʻou/hiki tatau/liliu ki he raster/fakatahaʻi, fakafonu lanu muʻa/puipuituʻa, Gaussian/Box/Motion Blur, Fakamāsila, Unsharp Mask, Median, mo e ngaahi fakatonutonu.
actions.unsupported_help = ʻOku ʻikai lekooti ʻa e ngaahi tā ʻo e poló, fili fakalima ʻo e Layer, liliu faʻunga, folau ʻi he hisitōliá, sivi mei tuʻa pe fakafalala ki he maʻuʻanga tokoní, sivi noa pē, fokotuʻunga sivi, mo e ngaahi fekau faile/polokalama. ʻOku ʻikai poupouʻi ʻa e fakatonutonu channel tupuʻanga mo e ngaahi fakatonutonu CMYK/Lab ʻoku liliu tuʻuloá.
actions.replay_help = ʻOku fakataumuʻa ʻa e ngaahi sitepú ki he Layer lolotongá mo e feituʻu kuo fili lolotongá. ʻOku fakafoki ʻe he Fakafoki ʻe taha ʻa e ngāue kakató. Kapau ʻoku tōnounou ha sitepu, ʻoku fakafoki ʻa e ngāue kakató. ʻOku fakatonutonu ʻe he ngaahi meʻangāue fakafiká ʻa e ngāue lolotongá; ʻoku tauhi ʻe he Tauhi ʻa e ngāué ʻa e ngaahi liliú.
