actions.batch_help = ʻOku kamata ʻa e toe fakahoko ʻi he fakahāʻanga ʻīmisí mei he fakatonutonu kuo tauhi ʻo e tā takitaha kapau ʻoku ʻi ai, ka ʻikai mei he tupuʻangá, fakataha mo hono Layer lolotonga kuo tauhí pe Layer pikisi ʻi ʻolunga tahá. Ko e ngaahi olá ko e ngaahi tatau PSD foʻou ʻi he faile faʻoʻanga kuo ke filí. ʻOku ʻikai liliu ʻa e ngaahi tupuʻangá mo e fakatonutonu kuo tauhí.
